{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12110090","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12110090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1211009001:1":{"text":"見ろ！あったぞ！","source_cn":"看！找到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x032184BDBAABA21F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1211009002:0":{"text":"鍵と言っても、見た目は小さな石ですね。","source_cn":"原来所谓的钥匙是一个小石块啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0D7A316F25740B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211009003:1":{"text":"ついに一つ目の戦利品、<style=\"highlight\">疾走の鍵</style>を手に入れたぞ！","source_cn":"总算到手了！<style=highlight>奔行之钥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BC44333B6335A49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211009004:1":{"text":"見ろよ、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>。この形、滝の所にあった石の台座の溝にピッタリはまるんじゃねぇか？","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8FC6AB3F5CEE28B2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"見ろよ、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>。この形、滝の所にあった石の台座の溝にピッタリはまるんじゃねぇか？","female":"見ろよ、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>。この形、滝の所にあった石の台座の溝にピッタリはまるんじゃねぇか？","variant_male_record_index":"130800","variant_female_record_index":"130801","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1211009004":{"text":"見ろよ、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>。この形、滝の所にあった石の台座の溝にピッタリはまるんじゃねぇか？","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>，你们看，形状是不是能对上瀑布汇流那个地方的石底座？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8FC6AB3F5CEE28B2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"見ろよ、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>。この形、滝の所にあった石の台座の溝にピッタリはまるんじゃねぇか？","female":"見ろよ、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>。この形、滝の所にあった石の台座の溝にピッタリはまるんじゃねぇか？","variant_male_record_index":"130800","variant_female_record_index":"130801","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211009005:1":{"text":"だろ？三つの溝の一つをこれで埋めるんだな。","source_cn":"对吧，刚好可以填上那三个底座凹槽中的一个。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCFED5F61C3E621E9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"だろ？三つの溝の一つをこれで埋めるんだな。","female":"だろ？三つの溝の一つをこれで埋めるんだな。","variant_male_record_index":"130802","variant_female_record_index":"130803","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211009006:1":{"text":"少なくともこれで、歌に出てくる財宝は実在するって証明されたんだ！","source_cn":"至少，它能证明那首民谣里的宝藏真实存在！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBD2D4CD4527A6C81","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"少なくともこれで、歌に出てくる財宝は実在するって証明されたんだ！","female":"少なくともこれで、歌に出てくる財宝は実在するって証明されたんだ！","variant_male_record_index":"130804","variant_female_record_index":"130805","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211009007:1":{"text":"宝なんてあるはずがないって、オヤジのことをバカにしてた奴らに見せてやりてぇぜ。","source_cn":"有些人并不相信，认为我那一心寻宝的船长老爹是个傻子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6111F021E917D5B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1211009008:1":{"text":"オヤジさんの夢を代わりに叶えたな。","source_cn":"现在，你帮他找到了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x793CEF795DF7B67D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1211009009:0":{"text":"まだ一つ目の鍵を手に入れただけだけどな。残りの二つもきばってこーぜ！","source_cn":"还早呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79807000A595CA70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1211009010:0":{"text":"そうピリピリすんなって。試練じゃなくて、子どもの頃にやったゲームだと思えばいいんだ。","source_cn":"放轻松点，别想着试炼了，你当它是个游戏，就像小时候玩过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x406B609F49EFD5DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1211009011:1":{"text":"そうだよ、お姉ちゃん！ここ、すっごく楽しいよ！","source_cn":"是啊，姐姐，而且这里很好玩！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DF805F73E8085FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1211009012:0":{"text":"ぐるぐる考えてたら、楽しめないよ！","source_cn":"如果想得太多，就一点都不好玩了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A1F20EC70126DC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1211009013:0":{"text":"……そうだな、ナーラの言うとおり、ゲームは何も考えずに楽しむものだ。","source_cn":"……是啊，奈拉，你说得对。这是一场游戏，全情投入才足够好玩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x614100AB5ECA22F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"そのようだな。","source_cn":"好像是","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x58BF8506C2FAAC53","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"そのようだな。","female":"そうみたいね。","variant_male_record_index":"65784","variant_female_record_index":"65785","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"覚えてない。","source_cn":"不记得了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3462EFF7896CB3F4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"覚えてない。","female":"覚えてないわ。","variant_male_record_index":"65786","variant_female_record_index":"65787","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"シンドバッド","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"ソニア","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奈拉":{"text":"ナーラ","source":"奈拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":17,"localized_text_count":16,"speaker_count":4}}